@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### GET Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ─────────────────────────────────────────
### Workspaces
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

### List all workspaces
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces

### Get a workspace by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces/lz

### ─────────────────────────────────────────
### Drift reports
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Get the latest drift result for a (workspace, layer, tf-workspace) tuple
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces/lz/drift/apps/prod

### Report drift – drifted (posted by CI/CD pipeline after tofu plan)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces/lz/drift/apps/prod
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "drifted",
  "add_count": 2,
  "change_count": 1,
  "destroy_count": 0,
  "scanned_at": "2026-03-23T10:00:00Z"
}

### Report drift – clean
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces/lz/drift/apps/prod
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "clean",
  "add_count": 0,
  "change_count": 0,
  "destroy_count": 0,
  "scanned_at": "2026-03-23T10:00:00Z"
}

### Report drift – error (plan execution failed in CI)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces/lz/drift/apps/prod
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "error",
  "add_count": 0,
  "change_count": 0,
  "destroy_count": 0,
  "error_message": "tofu init failed: unable to reach backend"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────
### Hierarchy
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Get the merged GCP hierarchy for a workspace
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hierarchy/lz

### Sync hierarchy from a GCS state file
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hierarchy/sync
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workspace_id": "lz",
  "layer_id": "apps",
  "tf_workspace_id": "prod",
  "bucket": "my-tf-states",
  "object": "lz/apps/prod.tfstate"
}

### Sync hierarchy – defaults (omitted IDs fall back to "default")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hierarchy/sync
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bucket": "my-tf-states",
  "object": "default.tfstate"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────
### Webhooks – Git
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Git webhook – explicit workspace / layer / tf-workspace
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/git
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workspace_id": "lz",
  "layer_id": "network",
  "tf_workspace_id": "prod",
  "bucket": "my-tf-states",
  "object": "lz/network/prod.tfstate"
}

### Git webhook – minimal body (layer + tf_workspace default to "default")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/git
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workspace_id": "lz",
  "bucket": "my-tf-states",
  "object": "lz/default.tfstate"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────
### Webhooks – GCS (Pub/Sub push)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────
### message.data is base64( {"bucket":"my-tf-states","name":"lz/apps/prod.tfstate","eventType":"OBJECT_FINALIZE"} )

### GCS notification – OBJECT_FINALIZE → triggers sync
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/gcs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": {
    "data": "eyJidWNrZXQiOiJteS10Zi1zdGF0ZXMiLCJuYW1lIjoibHovYXBwcy9wcm9kLnRmc3RhdGUiLCJldmVudFR5cGUiOiJPQkpFQ1RfRklOQUxJWkUifQ=="
  }
}

### GCS notification – OBJECT_DELETE → ignored (200 {"status":"ignored"})
### message.data is base64( {"bucket":"my-tf-states","name":"lz/apps/prod.tfstate","eventType":"OBJECT_DELETE"} )
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/gcs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": {
    "data": "eyJidWNrZXQiOiJteS10Zi1zdGF0ZXMiLCJuYW1lIjoibHovYXBwcy9wcm9kLnRmc3RhdGUiLCJldmVudFR5cGUiOiJPQkpFQ1RfREVMRVRFIn0="
  }
}

### GCS notification – non-.tfstate file → ignored (200 {"status":"ignored"})
### message.data is base64( {"bucket":"my-tf-states","name":"lz/apps/plan.out","eventType":"OBJECT_FINALIZE"} )
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/gcs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": {
    "data": "eyJidWNrZXQiOiJteS10Zi1zdGF0ZXMiLCJuYW1lIjoibHovYXBwcy9wbGFuLm91dCIsImV2ZW50VHlwZSI6Ik9CSkVDVF9GSU5BTElaRSJ9"
  }
}

